        <activityName xml:lang="en">xxx Sawn timber, softwood, raw, forest-debarked, u=70%, at plant</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: xxx Sawn timber, softwood, raw, forest-debarked, u=70%, at plant
The volume refers to the wood not including the bark. The multi-output process "sawing, softwood, forest-debarked, at plant" delivers the two coproducts "sawn timber, softwood, raw, forest-debarked, u=70%, at plant" and "industrial residue wood, softwood, forest-debarked, u=70%, at plant". Allocation is based on the over-all proceeds of the process.;
UUID: f32119db-f508-3a66-b5ec-c135906c261f
Includes transports of debarked roundwood from forest, sawing a sawmill
Location: &lt;null&gt;
Technology: Technology mix used in Germany 1986
Time period: undefined
Production volume: na
Sampling: Literature 
Extrapolations: see Geography and Technology
Uncertainty adjustments: The assumption that Germany is representative for central Europe is considered in the uncertainties.
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_f32119db-f508-3a66-b5ec-c135906c261f.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
